when we hear "reverse" we should think about "Stack".
we create a stack and move queue to it,
then bring back element from stack to queue.
the queue is reversed now!

Note: the reverse() method return void,
      we just pass the address of the queue
      and update it!

Note: when we use for-each loop
      we can not modify the object that we are iterating on it!
      so we use while!

Note: the cost of reverse() is
      O(n)